{'symbol': 'WEC', 'date': '2022-04-28 14:00:00', 'title': 'CLEAN ENERGY INVESTMENTS AND GRID HARDENING PART OF WPS RATE PLAN', 'text': 'GREEN BAY, WIS. , APRIL 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WISCONSIN PUBLIC SERVICE (WPS) FILED PROPOSALS WITH THE PUBLIC SERVICE COMMISSION OF WISCONSIN (PSCW) TODAY FOR REGULATORY REVIEWS THAT WILL SET CUSTOMER RATES FOR ELECTRICITY AND NATURAL GAS FOR 2023.'}